<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in</p>
<p>the $450,000 Hamburg women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Anne Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Petra Langrova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-1 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 6-Mary Pierce (France) 2-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-1</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain) beat 2-Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>7-5 5-7 6-2</p>
</text>
